1
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:12,530
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:15,700
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:18,530
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:21,710
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:26,050
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:29,270
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:32,070
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:35,940
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:39,410
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:42,760
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:45,680
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:49,010
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,940 --> 00:00:58,860
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,140 --> 00:01:00,380
=Episode 10=

15
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:02,320
Are we that close?

16
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:03,790
See?

17
00:01:04,510 --> 00:01:05,480
I called it.

18
00:01:06,230 --> 00:01:07,120
That gave me a scare.

19
00:01:08,310 --> 00:01:09,920
I thought his luck had turned.

20
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:12,590
I overstepped.

21
00:01:13,510 --> 00:01:14,640
Glad you know it.

22
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:16,200
Zhao Feiyang.

23
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:19,680
Cuihua is now the young sect master
of the Heavenly Sword Sect.

24
00:01:20,230 --> 00:01:22,040
Show her the proper respect

25
00:01:22,350 --> 00:01:23,350
from now on.

26
00:01:23,590 --> 00:01:24,400
Young Sect Master?

27
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:26,400
Good. Very good.

28
00:01:27,310 --> 00:01:28,040
No matter what,

29
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:29,640
I'm genuinely happy for you

30
00:01:30,040 --> 00:01:31,040
and how far you've come.

31
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:32,760
Are you really happy for me,

32
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:35,280
or do you actually regret it?

33
00:01:37,120 --> 00:01:37,710
Regret it?

34
00:01:38,310 --> 00:01:39,920
The clown you once looked down on

35
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:41,710
has completely transformed

36
00:01:41,950 --> 00:01:43,590
and is now the young sect master.

37
00:01:44,120 --> 00:01:45,310
Don't you regret it?

38
00:01:45,590 --> 00:01:46,640
I... I...

39
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,120
Why would I?

40
00:01:48,590 --> 00:01:50,120
I know how proud you are.

41
00:01:50,640 --> 00:01:51,840
Of course you won't admit it.

42
00:01:52,510 --> 00:01:53,510
But now that we're here,

43
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:54,790
there are things

44
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:56,680
I need to make clear.

45
00:01:57,350 --> 00:01:59,920
(Heavenly Sword Sect)
I used to cling to you,

46
00:02:00,350 --> 00:02:01,040
(Heavenly Sword Sect)
but only because

47
00:02:01,070 --> 00:02:02,280
(Heavenly Sword Sect)
I was young and naive.

48
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:04,840
Now, strength rules the world.

49
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:06,280
You and I

50
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:08,310
belong to different worlds.

51
00:02:12,310 --> 00:02:13,430
Now I understand.

52
00:02:14,190 --> 00:02:14,590
I get it.

53
00:02:15,430 --> 00:02:15,840
I get it.

54
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:19,710
You're always like this.

55
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:21,520
Even at rock bottom,

56
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:23,280
you still look down on everyone.

57
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:24,520
Deep down,

58
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:26,590
you feel inferior to everyone else,

59
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:27,520
don't you?

60
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:29,630
Whatever you say.

61
00:02:31,310 --> 00:02:31,910
Back then,

62
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:33,750
you stood up for me.

63
00:02:34,870 --> 00:02:36,520
And I saved your life
in the Alchemy Hall.

64
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:38,710
Now we're even.

65
00:02:42,470 --> 00:02:43,280
You saved me?

66
00:02:43,710 --> 00:02:44,150
Yes.

67
00:02:45,150 --> 00:02:46,310
When the fire poison ran wild,

68
00:02:47,710 --> 00:02:49,190
I took all of it on myself.

69
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:53,000
What?

70
00:02:55,150 --> 00:02:55,910
This... This...

71
00:02:58,120 --> 00:02:59,150
What a shameless boast.

72
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:02,280
Never mind that some villain

73
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:04,310
made the fire poison run wild
in the Alchemy Hall.

74
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:06,280
Even ordinary fire poison

75
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:08,910
is more than someone at your level

76
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,030
could withstand.

77
00:03:10,710 --> 00:03:11,840
You could barely save yourself.

78
00:03:12,190 --> 00:03:13,120
How could you save her?

79
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:13,960
Zhao Feiyang.

80
00:03:14,310 --> 00:03:15,960
Have you lost your mind?

81
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:17,120
Are you saying this

82
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:19,150
to make her feel indebted to you?

83
00:03:19,910 --> 00:03:21,150
You're disgusting.

84
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:22,030
Exactly.

85
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:24,000
Young Sect Master, don't believe him.

86
00:03:24,310 --> 00:03:25,520
If anything, you saved him.

87
00:03:26,150 --> 00:03:27,400
But I seem to recall...

88
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:28,680
Zhao Feiyang.

89
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:30,590
Did you really save Cuihua?

90
00:03:32,030 --> 00:03:32,910
Yes, Sect Master.

91
00:03:34,150 --> 00:03:36,080
Isn't that a little too...

92
00:03:36,190 --> 00:03:37,560
Whether anyone believes me or not
doesn't matter.

93
00:03:38,150 --> 00:03:39,190
What matters is I did it.

94
00:03:39,870 --> 00:03:41,240
My conscience is clear.

95
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:48,280
I've spent seven years in this sect.

96
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,190
I'm grateful for all the sect taught me.

97
00:03:52,590 --> 00:03:54,000
Given how things are now,

98
00:03:54,470 --> 00:03:54,910
Sect Master,

99
00:03:55,310 --> 00:03:56,030
I don't think

100
00:03:56,590 --> 00:03:58,560
I can remain in the sect anymore.

101
00:04:03,560 --> 00:04:05,560
You want to withdraw from
the Heavenly Sword Sect?

102
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:13,470
Yes.

103
00:04:22,430 --> 00:04:23,240
Zhao Feiyang.

104
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,720
You've made a wise choice.

105
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:27,310
You may be able to cultivate again,

106
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:29,430
but you're past the best age
to cultivate.

107
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:30,800
If you stay,

108
00:04:31,480 --> 00:04:32,070
you'll only cut into

109
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:34,190
the other disciples'
cultivation resources.

110
00:04:35,750 --> 00:04:36,950
Please grant my request, Sect Master.

111
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:40,360
We've known each other for years.

112
00:04:42,160 --> 00:04:42,830
At first,

113
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:45,360
you were my most promising disciple.

114
00:04:46,070 --> 00:04:47,750
But times have changed.

115
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:50,070
So much has happened lately.

116
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:52,240
I won't ask you to stay.

117
00:04:53,190 --> 00:04:53,920
Zhao Feiyang.

118
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:55,310
Do you know

119
00:04:55,750 --> 00:04:58,360
what withdrawing from the sect entails?

120
00:04:59,310 --> 00:04:59,750
I do.

121
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:00,870
Good.

122
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:02,920
Elder Wang.

123
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:05,270
Every disciple who withdraws
from the sect

124
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:06,680
must face two trials.

125
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:07,680
The first

126
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:10,190
is three lashes
from the Dragon Sinew Whip.

127
00:05:22,430 --> 00:05:23,120
Zhao Feiyang.

128
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:25,800
Your meridians were just restored.

129
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:27,720
The whip is extremely powerful.

130
00:05:28,190 --> 00:05:30,560
Even cultivators in the
Spirit Burst Realm

131
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:31,720
can barely withstand it.

132
00:05:32,190 --> 00:05:34,070
Let alone someone at your level.

133
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:35,600
Sect Master,

134
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:37,430
Zhao Feiyang acted rashly.

135
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:39,240
Please give him another chance

136
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:39,950
to reconsider.

137
00:05:39,950 --> 00:05:41,190
It's his choice.

138
00:05:41,430 --> 00:05:42,560
Why bother looking out for him?

139
00:05:42,870 --> 00:05:43,920
I'm just reminding him.

140
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:45,920
Zhao Feiyang.

141
00:05:46,830 --> 00:05:48,600
For Elder Murong's sake,

142
00:05:49,270 --> 00:05:51,240
I'll let you think it over again.

143
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:52,800
My mind is made up.

144
00:05:54,190 --> 00:05:55,270
He may talk tough,

145
00:05:55,390 --> 00:05:57,040
but Zhao Feiyang does have guts.

146
00:05:57,070 --> 00:05:57,950
Guts?

147
00:05:58,360 --> 00:06:00,430
He's just a reckless fool.

148
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:01,800
(What an idiot.)

149
00:06:02,070 --> 00:06:03,310
(His meridians were just healed,)

150
00:06:03,310 --> 00:06:04,600
(and now he's taking the whip?)

151
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,830
(How is that not courting death?)

152
00:06:07,270 --> 00:06:08,160
In that case,

153
00:06:08,430 --> 00:06:09,040
Elder Wang,

154
00:06:09,630 --> 00:06:10,360
give him the lashes.

155
00:06:11,270 --> 00:06:11,870
Zhao Feiyang.

156
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:13,190
Get ready.

157
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:14,270
First lash.

158
00:06:14,630 --> 00:06:15,310
Here it comes.

159
00:06:32,630 --> 00:06:33,310
Not bad.

160
00:06:33,750 --> 00:06:35,510
You actually withstood the first lash.

161
00:06:36,430 --> 00:06:36,920
Then,

162
00:06:37,950 --> 00:06:38,720
the second lash.

163
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:39,720
Here it comes.

164
00:06:50,630 --> 00:06:51,360
Good heavens.

165
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:51,920
He...

166
00:06:52,310 --> 00:06:53,920
He's withstood two lashes.

167
00:06:54,310 --> 00:06:56,190
Did Elder Wang go easy on him?

168
00:06:56,190 --> 00:06:56,830
Impossible.

169
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:58,510
Elder Wang has never liked

170
00:06:58,510 --> 00:06:59,750
Zhao Feiyang.

171
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:01,510
Why would he hold back?

172
00:07:02,070 --> 00:07:04,000
Of all disciples who've left,

173
00:07:04,750 --> 00:07:06,800
none stayed standing after two.

174
00:07:07,390 --> 00:07:08,390
How did he do it?

175
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:10,120
(The whip striking him)

176
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:11,870
(feels like striking mystic iron.)

177
00:07:12,390 --> 00:07:14,830
(His body is incredibly tough.)

178
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:15,830
(No.)

179
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:17,160
(On the third lash,)

180
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:18,750
(I'll use more force.)

181
00:07:45,390 --> 00:07:46,510
He actually endured it.

182
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:48,070
He's still alive.

183
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:49,190
He's so strong!

184
00:07:54,430 --> 00:07:55,190
Who would've thought?

185
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,240
He withstood it.

186
00:07:59,800 --> 00:08:00,190
This...

187
00:08:00,510 --> 00:08:01,270
How is this possible?

188
00:08:01,430 --> 00:08:02,310
This is unbelievable.

189
00:08:04,510 --> 00:08:06,390
So this is the legendary
Dragon Sinew Whip?

190
00:08:07,070 --> 00:08:08,270
It's nothing special.

191
00:08:08,430 --> 00:08:08,950
You...

192
00:08:09,190 --> 00:08:09,870
Arrogant!

193
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:13,600
Sect Master.

194
00:08:13,950 --> 00:08:15,040
Since he's so defiant,

195
00:08:15,270 --> 00:08:16,240
let the final trial

196
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:17,310
begin.

197
00:08:17,430 --> 00:08:18,160
Zhao Feiyang.

198
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:20,510
The final trial is no small matter.

199
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:22,310
I never wanted to see this,

200
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:23,920
but you're determined.

201
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:25,160
There's nothing else I can do.

202
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:58,480
This is our sect's
Demon-Suppressing Beast.

203
00:08:58,840 --> 00:09:00,960
It may not be a top-tier demon beast,

204
00:09:01,750 --> 00:09:03,840
but it's exceptionally powerful.

205
00:09:04,030 --> 00:09:05,120
Once it locks onto you,

206
00:09:05,270 --> 00:09:06,120
it won't stop until one of you dies.

207
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:07,390
Zhao Feiyang.

208
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:09,720
As long as you escape from its jaws,

209
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:11,440
you'll pass the final trial.

210
00:09:11,750 --> 00:09:12,750
For centuries,

211
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:14,630
no one has ever passed it.

212
00:09:15,630 --> 00:09:17,080
With his meager cultivation?

213
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:18,270
Even I

214
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:20,440
may not escape unscathed.

215
00:09:20,670 --> 00:09:22,080
Zhao Feiyang, run!

216
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:22,670
Wait.

217
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:23,630
Zhao Feiyang.

218
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:25,320
If you tell me

219
00:09:25,630 --> 00:09:27,360
you were wrong and regret it,

220
00:09:27,870 --> 00:09:29,670
I'll ask Father to revoke the order

221
00:09:30,390 --> 00:09:31,120
and let you off.

222
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:32,000
You can't do that.

223
00:09:32,270 --> 00:09:32,840
Young Sect Master.

224
00:09:33,080 --> 00:09:34,270
Why are you still favoring him?

225
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:36,750
Cuihua is the young sect master.

226
00:09:36,870 --> 00:09:38,750
I can grant her request.

227
00:09:39,030 --> 00:09:39,670
Zhao Feiyang.

228
00:09:40,030 --> 00:09:40,960
Think carefully.

229
00:09:42,550 --> 00:09:43,360
I have no regrets.

230
00:09:44,790 --> 00:09:45,750
Nor was I wrong.

231
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:53,270
Fine.

232
00:09:53,870 --> 00:09:55,200
In that case,

233
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:57,960
there's nothing more to say.

234
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:06,790
Go.

235
00:10:12,720 --> 00:10:13,630
(After all I've been through,)

236
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:15,270
(how could I stop here?)

237
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,030
(Today, I'll see)

238
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:18,870
(what Stage 3 of the
Spirit Burst Realm can do)

239
00:10:19,390 --> 00:10:21,360
(against this demon beast.)

240
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:36,510
What?

241
00:10:36,550 --> 00:10:37,270
How is this possible?

242
00:10:37,270 --> 00:10:38,150
How did he do that?

243
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:38,910
What's going on?

244
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:40,000
How can this be?

245
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:40,790
Why did it suddenly...

246
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:41,720
(What's happening?)

247
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,320
(My Dao Bone is actually reacting.)

248
00:10:43,870 --> 00:10:44,630
(Could it somehow)

249
00:10:45,240 --> 00:10:46,240
(be linked to this beast?)

250
00:10:51,910 --> 00:10:52,320
What?

251
00:10:56,720 --> 00:10:57,480
How is this possible?

252
00:10:57,750 --> 00:11:00,000
Its demonic aura actually vanished
in an instant.

253
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:02,360
Unless it has no will to fight,

254
00:11:02,630 --> 00:11:03,870
this should be impossible.

255
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:05,320
Am I seeing things?

256
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:07,750
He's actually toying with the beast.

257
00:11:13,870 --> 00:11:14,270
What?

258
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:23,120
I've passed the second trial too.

259
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:24,390
From this day forth,

260
00:11:25,670 --> 00:11:27,120
I owe this sect nothing.

261
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:29,440
This...

262
00:11:34,390 --> 00:11:34,840
Everyone,

263
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:36,960
until we meet again
in the martial world.

264
00:11:43,100 --> 00:11:46,890
♪I once stood on high, drawing
spiritual energy into my blade♪

265
00:11:47,140 --> 00:11:49,290
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

266
00:11:49,860 --> 00:11:53,410
♪Then came my fall, with frost
and snow on my shoulders♪

267
00:11:53,540 --> 00:11:57,970
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

268
00:11:58,140 --> 00:12:01,290
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

269
00:12:02,130 --> 00:12:04,800
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

270
00:12:05,020 --> 00:12:08,420
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

271
00:12:08,500 --> 00:12:12,230
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

272
00:12:13,100 --> 00:12:16,270
♪I seek the Dao
beyond the clouds♪

273
00:12:16,540 --> 00:12:19,660
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

274
00:12:20,460 --> 00:12:22,980
♪With this flesh and soul♪

275
00:12:23,300 --> 00:12:26,530
♪I shall forge a new age♪

276
00:12:26,740 --> 00:12:29,610
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

277
00:12:29,980 --> 00:12:33,070
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

278
00:12:33,290 --> 00:12:35,930
♪At cultivation's peak♪

279
00:12:35,940 --> 00:12:39,290
♪My first resolve
remains unchanged♪

280
00:12:40,060 --> 00:12:42,770
♪The sun and moon turn♪

281
00:12:42,770 --> 00:12:46,290
♪I hear the Great Dao ring♪

282
00:12:46,680 --> 00:12:53,270
♪I am the undying flame♪

283
00:12:54,260 --> 00:12:58,930
♪Looking back when dust settles♪

284
00:12:59,190 --> 00:13:02,290
♪At last I see, immortality♪

285
00:13:02,740 --> 00:13:07,430
♪Lives in your smiles♪
